{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_29", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_29.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "No, go in there with them, Captain Horster; I want to hear more about\u2014.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Very well, I will wait, then.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "(He follows MRS. STOCKMANN and PETRA into the sitting-room.)", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "I daresay you find it rather draughty here today.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Put your hat on.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you, if I may.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "(Does so.)", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "I think I caught cold last night; I stood and shivered\u2014", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Really?", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "I found it warm enough.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "I regret that it was not in my power to prevent those excesses last night.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you anything in particular to say to me besides that?", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (taking a big letter from his pocket).", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "I have this document for you, from the Baths Committee.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "My dismissal?", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, dating from today.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "(Lays the letter on the table.)", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "It gives us pain to do it; but, to speak frankly, we dared not do otherwise on account of public opinion.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (smiling).", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Dared not?", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "I seem to have heard that word before, today.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "I must beg you to understand your position clearly.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "For the future you must not count on any practice whatever in the town.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Devil take the practice!", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "But why are you so sure of that?", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "The Householders' Association is circulating a list from house to house.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "All right-minded citizens are being called upon to give up employing you; and I can assure you that not a single head of a family will risk refusing his signature.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "They simply dare not.", "para": 13, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "No, no; I don't doubt it.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "But what then?", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "If I might advise you, it would be best to leave the place for a little while\u2014", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, the propriety of leaving the place has occurred to me.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Good.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "And then, when you have had six months to think things over, if, after mature consideration, you can persuade yourself to write a few words of regret, acknowledging your error\u2014", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "I might have my appointment restored to me, do you mean?", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Perhaps.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "It is not at all impossible.", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "But what about public opinion, then?", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Surely you would not dare to do it on account of public feeling...", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Public opinion is an extremely mutable thing.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "And, to be quite candid with you, it is a matter of great importance to us to have some admission of that sort from you in writing.", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, that's what you are after, is it!", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "I will just trouble you to remember what I said to you lately about foxy tricks of that sort!", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Your position was quite different then.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "At that time you had reason to suppose you had the whole town at your back\u2014", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, and now I feel I have the whole town ON my back\u2014(flaring up).", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "I would not do it if I had the devil and his dam on my back\u2014!", "para": 24, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Never\u2014never, I tell you!", "para": 24, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "A man with a family has no right to behave as you do.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "You have no right to do it, Thomas.", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "I have no right!", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "There is only one single thing in the world a free man has no right to do.", "para": 26, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you know what that is?", "para": 26, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "No.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course you don't, but I will tell you.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "A free man has no right to soil himself with filth; he has no right to behave in a way that would justify his spitting in his own face.", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "This sort of thing sounds extremely plausible, of course; and if there were no other explanation for your obstinacy\u2014.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "But as it happens that there is.", "para": 29, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you mean?", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "You understand, very well what I mean.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "But, as your brother and as a man of discretion, I advise you not to build too much upon expectations and prospects that may so very easily fail you.", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "What in the world is all this about?", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you really ask me to believe that you are ignorant of the terms of Mr. Kiil's will?", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "I know that the small amount he possesses is to go to an institution for indigent old workpeople.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "How does that concern me?", "para": 34, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "In the first place, it is by no means a small amount that is in question.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Mr. Kiil is a fairly wealthy man.", "para": 35, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "I had no notion of that!", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Hm!\u2014hadn't you really?", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Then I suppose you had no notion, either, that a considerable portion of his wealth will come to your children, you and your wife having a life-rent of the capital.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Has he never told you so?", "para": 37, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Never, on my honour!", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite the reverse; he has consistently done nothing but fume at being so unconscionably heavily taxed.", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "But are you perfectly certain of this, Peter?", "para": 38, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "I have it from an absolutely reliable source.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Then, thank God, Katherine is provided for\u2014and the children too!", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "I must tell her this at once\u2014(calls out) Katherine, Katherine!", "para": 40, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (restraining him).", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "Hush, don't say a word yet!", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (opening the door).", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "What is the matter?", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, nothing, nothing; you can go back.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "(She shuts the door.", "para": 43, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 124, "kind": "action", "text": "DR. STOCKMANN walks up and down in his excitement.)", "para": 43, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 125, "kind": "action", "text": "Provided for!\u2014Just think of it, we are all provided for!", "para": 43, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 126, "kind": "action", "text": "And for life!", "para": 43, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 127, "kind": "action", "text": "What a blessed feeling it is to know one is provided for!", "para": 43, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 128, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 129, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, but that is just exactly what you are not.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 130, "kind": "action", "text": "Mr. Kiil can alter his will any day he likes.", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}]}